# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Soohaeng Yoo Willow et al. (2026). Bayesian equivariant interatomic potential with iterative restratification of many-body message passing.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-026-02258-9  arXiv:2510.03046v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2510.03046v2 (sha256 0fd388d3ed2b3b5f...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 123 (Method/model). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the RACE architecture (introduced here) as a
# deterministic potential on the two standard force-field benchmarks:
# seven rMD17 molecules (Table 3) and 3BPA trained at 300 K and tested at
# 300, 600 and 1200 K (Table 4, hyperparameters of Table S5). The
# Bayesian variants and the uncertainty-quantification study are
# described in the gaps.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
